        "short_description": "Nicotinamide<br>\nAdenine <br>\nDinucleotide",
        "description": "<b>NAD+</b> is a vital coenzyme that works at the cellular level to boost energy, repair DNA and rejuvenate your skin from within. The future of skinacre - <b>now in India.</b>",
